<figure class="backend-diagram" aria-label="Spec-driven backend architecture">
  <div class="architecture-sheet">
    <header class="drawing-header">
      <span>CAO / Deployment architecture</span>
      <span class="drawing-tag">Cloud-neutral</span>
    </header>
    <div class="spec-node">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 3h12l6 6v20H7zM19 3v7h6M13 15l-3 3 3 3m6-6 3 3-3 3m-2-7-2 8" /></svg>
      <div>
        <strong>CAO / TypeSpec contracts</strong>
        <span>HTTP API · Storage schema · Analytics contracts</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contract-route"><span>Generate contracts. Implement the backend.</span></div>
    <div class="backend-boundary">
      <div class="boundary-label">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 18H6a4 4 0 0 1-1-8 7 7 0 0 1 13-2 5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-1M9 15l-3 3 3 3m6-6 3 3-3 3m-2-7-2 8" /></svg>
        <span>Your infrastructure</span>
        <span class="boundary-detail">Deployment boundary</span>
      </div>
      <div class="architecture-network">
        <div class="backend-node server-node">
          <span class="service-kind">Compute</span>
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 7h36v13H6zM6 28h36v13H6zM11 13h2m4 0h2m-8 22h2m4 0h2M31 13h6m-6 22h6M24 20v8" /></svg>
          </div>
          <strong>CAO server</strong>
          <span>Go / Container</span>
          <small>API + auth + queries</small>
          <span class="service-port right-port" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="service-port bottom-port" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="network-route database-route" data-edge="server-to-postgres" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>Read / write</span>
        </div>
        <div class="backend-node database-node">
          <span class="service-kind">Database</span>
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="24" cy="10" rx="16" ry="6" /><path d="M8 10v27c0 8 32 8 32 0V10M8 23c0 8 32 8 32 0" /></svg>
          </div>
          <strong>PostgreSQL</strong>
          <span>Managed / Self-hosted</span>
          <small>Canonical evidence + isolated operational state</small>
          <span class="service-port left-port" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="archive-start" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="network-route archive-route" data-edge="server-to-objects" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>Opt-in archive</span>
        </div>
        <div class="archive-end" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="backend-node object-node optional-node">
          <span class="service-kind">Object store</span>
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10h34v31H7zM7 18h34M12 5h24v5M14 25h7v8h-7zM27 25h7v8h-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Object storage</strong>
          <span>Private / Parquet</span>
          <small>Approved session archive</small>
          <span class="service-port top-port" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="service-port left-port" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="network-route analytics-route" data-edge="analytics-to-objects" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>Query<br />Parquet</span>
        </div>
        <div class="backend-node analytics-node optional-node">
          <span class="service-kind">Analytics</span>
          <div class="service-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 6v35h35M14 34V23h5v11m6 0V15h5v19m6 0V7h5v27" /></svg>
          </div>
          <strong>Analytics engine</strong>
          <span>Parquet query engine</span>
          <small>Private-archive analytics</small>
          <span class="service-port right-port" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <footer class="network-legend">
        <span><i class="required-key" aria-hidden="true"></i> Core backend</span>
        <span><i class="optional-key" aria-hidden="true"></i> Optional archive + analytics</span>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Backend pattern, not automatic provisioning. The server reads and writes PostgreSQL;
    analytics queries approved Parquet in object storage. Object archives and analytics are independently opt-in;
    neither is required for PostgreSQL-backed dashboard queries. Custom providers need compatible adapters.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

